ASAP7 PDK and standard-cell library v1.7: Arizona State University, as packaged in OpenROAD-flow-scripts flow/platforms/asap7. Used in flow/platforms/*/lef*/asap7*, flow/platforms/*/lib*/**/asap7*, ASAP7 layers of the technology LEF files, setRC_*.tcl. Modifications: _bottom / _upper cell-name suffixes, two-tier technology LEF with the hb_layer hybrid-bond cut layer, CLASS COVER copies, cell subsets; license headers kept. License: BSD-3-Clause, Lawrence T. Clark, Vinay Vashishtha, or Arizona State University.
FakeRAM 2.0 memory macros: generated with FakeRAM 2.0 (https://github.com/maliberty/FakeRAM2.0), as packaged in the OpenROAD-flow-scripts ASAP7 platform. Used in flow/platforms/*/lef*/fakeram*, flow/platforms/*/lib*/**/fakeram*. Modifications: per-tier name suffixes and CLASS COVER copies. License: distributed with the OpenROAD-flow-scripts ASAP7 platform.
